     ppffiinndd() takes a _p_i_d as its argument and returns a pointer to the _p_r_o_c
     structure whose PID is specified in the argument only if the _p_i_d is on
     the _a_l_l_p_r_o_c list.

     zzppffiinndd() takes a _p_i_d as its argument.  If zzppffiinndd() finds a process whose
     PID is equal to that of argument and is a zombie process, meaning that it
